// code_generation v2 DRAFTS — HARDER algorithmic tasks (NOT production).
// Saturation: 6/16 finalists >=0.95 on v1 (string cleanup, simple regex, small
// list ops). These need real algorithm construction with tricky edge cases:
//   roman numerals (subtractive pairs), grouped aggregation, leap-year rules,
//   second-distinct-maximum, cents->currency formatting with thousands grouping.
// Schema IDENTICAL to live set: {id,prompt,function_name,tests:[{args,kwargs?,expected}],timeout_s}.
// Harness EXECUTES the code sandboxed; pass = every fn(*args,**kwargs)==expected.
